<tracker id="T9" parent_id="0" instantiate_for_new_projects="0">
  <name><![CDATA[Configuration Baseline]]></name>
  <item_name>config_baseline</item_name>
  <description><![CDATA[A Configuration Baseline is the frozen intersection of exactly one Variant (which features are selected, for one Product) and one point in the evolution/branch axis: it pins the exact version node of every Requirement, Design, Test Case, Document and Feature Constraint artifact that was current for that Variant at that point. Link this artifact to exactly one Product, exactly one Variant, and every pinned engineering-artifact version node - Tuleap groups linked artifacts by tracker type automatically on the artifact detail page, so no separate "Baseline Item" tracker is needed. Treat a published Configuration Baseline as immutable, same discipline as the Engineering Artifact trackers: never add, remove or re-point a link once status is Published - create a new Configuration Baseline artifact instead. Named "Configuration Baseline" rather than "Baseline" to avoid colliding with Tuleap's native Baselines plugin, which is scoped to Backlog milestones and not used by this design.]]></description>
  <color>red-wine</color>
  <cannedResponses/>
